{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.LinearChainBondCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.LinearChainBondCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Intervals","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.linear_chain_cluster_measure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.linear_chain_cluster_measure","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LinearChainBondCount.lean#L32-L67","doc":"**Aggregate cluster measure of the linear `A`-chain.**  Summing the bond count\n`(n−1)` over the `(A−n+1)` consecutive `n`-sub-clusters, for `n = 2..A`, equals\n`C(A+1,3)`.  Reindexed by `k = n−1` this is `Σ_{k<A} (A−k)·k`; stated `×6` to\navoid `ℕ` division.  (E.g. `A=4`: `0+3+4+3 = 10 = C(5,3)`.) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:linear-chain-bond-count","label":"prop:linear-chain-bond-count","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/linear-chain-bond-count.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.chainBonds_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.chainBonds_three","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LinearChainBondCount.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.chainBonds_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.chainBonds_two","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LinearChainBondCount.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.chainBonds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.chainBonds","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LinearChainBondCount.lean#L26-L27","doc":"The number of inter-nucleon bonds in a linear chain of `n` nucleons is `n−1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}